# The rendered vinyl styles (lpcore/cache/<family>/*.png plus each family's
# .keys.json) ARE committed: they are what was looked at and shipped, and the
# release workflow packs them as-is rather than rendering (`make prerender`
# re-renders only a style whose parameters or renderer changed, and CI fails
# if one was left stale). Only in-progress renders are ignored.
lpcore/cache/**/.*.part.png
lpcore/cache/**/.keys.json.part
